			<div class="content" id="post-content-4824893">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights</strong>: Yes (open to suggestions for modifications)</p>
<p><strong>Page Type</strong>: SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional)</strong>: Horror/Mystery</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional)</strong>: Normal document</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch</strong>: (Object class Keter formerly Euclid) A river within the middle east that erodes land around it at much faster rate attempting to form new branches to the river. Within the river a species of sentient fish resides that secrete an acidic substance that increases the erosion power of the river, and mind altering memetic effects.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative</strong>: Upon the foundation discovering and containing the river, the fish began gather at the bottom of the river attempting to tunnel out until re contained, after recontainment the fish begin appearing in the active sites water supply, and personal began behaving abnormally due to the mind altering effects of the fish in the water, and began requesting people around them drink more water or &quot;take a nice shower&quot; attempting to get personal to interact with water until fish were recontained. After the first rain the area had in years the fish break containment again, when people from a nearby settlement came over to attempt breaking down the walls surrounding the site saying their people need water despite there being bodies of water being much closer to their settlement than the river, upon the request being denied, the people turned iolent and were forced to be terminated, during autopsy the peoples and personals bodies were found to be filled with water and a single fully grown fish, the corener and their assistants disappeared and water damage was found in their living quarters. Personel's were abouts are still unknown</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber</strong>: the object class was changed from euclid to keter</p>

